        " sign-in code\":\"Aanmeldcode scannen\",\"Schedule\":\"Inplannen\",\"Search Tasks\":\"Taken zoeken\",\"Search tasks, projects, areas…\":\"Taken, projecten en gebieden zoeken…\",\"Section name\":\"Sectienaam\",\"Sections\":\"Secties\",\"See Plus\":\"Bekijk Plus\",\"See what Plus adds\":\"Ontdek wat Plus toevoegt\",\"See who changed what and bring back what you deleted. Your files open on every device.\":\"Bekijk wie wat heeft gewijzigd en herstel verwijderde items. Je bestanden zijn op elk apparaat beschikbaar.\",\"Select\":\"Selecteren\",\"Select All\":\"Alles selecteren\",\"Send\":\"Verzenden\",\"Send Back…\":\"Terugsturen…\",\"Send back\":\"Terugsturen\",\"Send back for another pass\":\"Terugsturen voor nog een ronde\",\"Send feedback\":\"Feedback sturen\",\"Septena\":\"Septena\",\"Septena Help\":\"Septena-hulp\",\"Septena Plus\":\"Septena Plus\",\"Septena Pro\":\"Septena Pro\",\"Septena Window\":\"Septena-venster\",\"Septena can’t add this. Paste a web link or a mail link.\":\"Septena kan dit niet toevoegen. Plak een weblink of een e-maillink.\",\"Septena can’t use the camera\":\"Septena kan de camera niet gebruiken\",\"Septena could not reach the server. Try again in a moment.\":\"Septena kan de server niet bereiken. Probeer het zo meteen opnieuw.\",\"Septena has no on-device model here, so Discuss hands the task to your own Claude. Recommended.\":\"Septena heeft hier geen model op het apparaat, dus geeft Overleggen de taak door aan jouw eigen Claude. Aanbevolen.\",\"Septena keeps deleted tasks here for 30 days, then deletes them for good.\":\"Septena bewaart verwijderde taken hier 30 dagen en verwijdert ze daarna definitief.\",\"Septena never runs AI on your data and never reads it. The intelligence is your own (Apple on-device, Private Cloud Compute, or your Claude). This only sets where requests may run.\":\"Septena voert nooit AI uit op je gegevens en leest die ook niet. De intelligentie is van jou (AI op je apparaat van Apple, Private Cloud Compute of jouw Claude). Dit bepaalt alleen waar aanvragen mogen worden uitgevoerd.\",\"Septena runs the sync server and the connector. When you connect Claude or another agent, its bill stays with that provider.\":\"Septena beheert de synchronisatieserver en de connector. Als je Claude of een andere agent verbindt, betaal je de kosten aan die aanbieder.\",\"Set up Septena for me using https://septena.app/agents.md\":\"Stel Septena voor me in met behulp van https://septena.app/agents.md\",\"Set up my Septena areas, projects, and tasks by following https://api.septena.app/onboard.md\":\"Stel mijn gebieden, projecten en taken in Septena in volgens https://api.septena.app/onboard.md\",\"Settings…\":\"Instellingen…\",\"Setup prompt\":\"Installatieprompt\",\"Share Project\":\"Project delen\",\"Share Project…\":\"Project delen…\",\"Shared by\":\"Gedeeld door\",\"Shared projects\":\"Gedeelde projecten\",\"Share…\":\"Delen…\",\"Sharing a project needs Plus\":\"Een project delen vereist Plus\",\"Show / Hide Sidebar\":\"Zijbalk tonen/verbergen\",\"Show Get Started Again\":\"Aan de slag opnieuw tonen\",\"Show Info\":\"Info tonen\",\"Show List\":\"Lijst tonen\",\"Show Sidebar\":\"Zijbalk tonen\",\"Show Sidebar Counts\":\"Aantallen in zijbalk tonen\",\"Show Welcome Again\":\"Welkomstscherm opnieuw tonen\",\"Show calendar events\":\"Agenda-afspraken tonen\",\"Show completed tasks\":\"Voltooide taken tonen\",\"Show faded tasks\":\"Vervaagde taken tonen\",\"Show faded tasks in projects and areas.\":\"Vervaagde taken in projecten en gebieden tonen.\",\"Show less\":\"Toon minder\",\"Show more\":\"Toon meer\",\"Shown when non-empty\":\"Alleen zichtbaar als er inhoud is\",\"Sign in\":\"Aanmelden\",\"Sign in on {client}?\":\"Aanmelden op {client}?\",\"Sign in so Claude can connect to your tasks through your private Septena account.\":\"Meld je aan zodat Claude via je privé Septena-account verbinding kan maken met je taken.\",\"Sign in to Septena\":\"Aanmelden bij Septena\",\"Sign in to Septena first.\":\"Log eerst in bij Septena.\",\"Sign in to Septena sync to create a private calendar feed URL for Apple Calendar, Google Calendar, or Outlook.\":\"Meld je aan bij Septena Sync om een privé-URL voor een agenda-feed te maken voor Apple Agenda, Google Agenda of Outlook.\",\"Sign in to connect Claude\":\"Meld je aan om Claude te verbinden\",\"Sign in to sync\":\"Meld je aan om te synchroniseren\",\"Sign in with Apple\":\"Meld je aan met Apple\",\"Sign in with Apple to keep your tasks on all your devices and to let Claude connect. Septena never sees your Apple password.\":\"Meld je aan met Apple om je taken op al je apparaten te bewaren en Claude te verbinden. Septena ziet je Apple-wachtwoord nooit.\",\"Sign in…\":\"Aanmelden…\",\"Sign out\":\"Afmelden\",\"Sign out {name}?\":\"Afmelden bij {name}?\",\"Skip\":\"Overslaan\",\"Slow drift\":\"Langzame drift\",\"Small\":\"Klein\",\"Smallest\":\"Kleinst\",\"Smart Lists\":\"Slimme lijsten\",\"Some help is always on your device\":\"Een deel van de hulp staat altijd op je apparaat\",\"Some tasks need thinking before you can act. Tap Discuss and talk them through, right on the task.\":\"Sommige taken vragen om nadenken voordat je iets kunt doen. Tik op Overleggen en bespreek ze direct bij de taak.\",\"Spreadsheet-friendly table of tasks\":\"Spreadsheetvriendelijke tabel met taken\",\"Starlings record\":\"Starlings-record\",\"Still on It\":\"Nog mee bezig\",\"Still on {title}?\":\"Nog bezig met {title}?\",\"Still want any of them?\":\"Wil je er nog een bewaren?\",\"Stipple Drift\":\"Gestippelde drift\",\"Stop\":\"Stoppen\",\"Stop for Now\":\"Voor nu stoppen\",\"Stopped for now\":\"Voor nu gestopt\",\"Stop Sharing\":\"Stoppen met delen\",\"Stopped\":\"Gestopt\",\"Subscribe\":\"Abonneren\",\"Subscriptions open at App Store launch.\":\"Abonnementen zijn beschikbaar zodra de App Store-versie wordt uitgebracht.\",\"Suggest where to file\":\"Stel een lijst voor\",\"Sunday\":\"Zondag\",\"Switched to another task\":\"Overgestapt op een andere taak\",\"Sync\":\"Synchroniseren\",\"Sync & storage diagnostics\":\"Diagnostiek voor synchronisatie en opslag\",\"Sync This Device\":\"Dit apparaat synchroniseren\",\"Sync issues\":\"Synchronisatieproblemen\",\"Synced\":\"Gesynchroniseerd\",\"Syncing\":\"Synchroniseert\",\"Syncing…\":\"Bezig met synchroniseren…\",\"System\":\"Systeem\",\"Tactile\":\"Tactiel\",\"Tags\":\"Tags\",\"Tags…\":\"Tags…\",\"Tamarillo\":\"Tamarillo\",\"Tap + to add a task.\":\"Tik op + om een taak toe te voegen.\",\"Task\":\"Taak\",\"Task Details\":\"Taakdetails\",\"Task conversations with the on-device model\":\"Taakgesprekken met het model op het apparaat\",\"Task deleted\":\"Taak verwijderd\",\"Task list\":\"Takenlijst\",\"Tasks\":\"Taken\",\"Tasks fade after 14 days without activity and move to Review. A deadline or a date ahead keeps a task out. Open or edit a task to bring it back. You can turn this off in Settings.\":\"Taken vervagen na 14 dagen zonder activiteit en gaan naar Beoordelen. Een deadline of een datum in de toekomst voorkomt dat. Open of bewerk een taak om hem terug te halen. Je kunt dit uitzetten in Instellingen.\",\"Tasks that think with you\":\"Taken die met je meedenken\",\"Tasks that think with you.\":\"Taken die met je meedenken.\",\"Tasks with a future When or Deadline date appear here.\":\"Taken met een toekomstige datum bij Wanneer of Deadline verschijnen hier.\",\"Tasks without activity for 14 days\":\"Taken zonder activiteit gedurende 14 dagen\",\"Tasks without activity for 14 days appear here until you keep them or let them go.\":\"Taken die 14 dagen geen activiteit hadden, verschijnen hier tot je ze houdt of loslaat.\",\"Tasks without activity for 14 days fade out and move to Review. This applies on all your devices.\":\"Taken zonder activiteit gedurende 14 dagen vervagen en gaan naar Beoordelen. Dit geldt op al je apparaten.\",\"Tasks you assign to Claude show up in Review, grouped by where the work stands.\":\"Taken die je aan Claude toewijst, verschijnen in Beoordelen, gegroepeerd op de voortgang.\",\"Tasks you complete or let go end up here.\":\"Taken die je voltooit of loslaat, komen hier terecht.\",\"Tasks, lists, projects and areas have no caps on any plan.\":\"Er geldt bij geen enkel abonnement een limiet voor taken, lijsten, projecten en gebieden.\",\"Text Size\":\"Tekstgrootte\",\"That code is wrong or has expired.\":\"De code is onjuist of verlopen.\",\"That code was already used.\":\"Deze code is al gebruikt.\",\"That device stops syncing within the hour. Its tasks stay on it until you sign in there again.\":\"Dat apparaat synchroniseert binnen een uur niet meer. De taken blijven erop staan totdat je je daar opnieuw aanmeldt.\",\"The brief did not load. Check your connection and open this page again.\":\"De handleiding is niet geladen. Controleer je verbinding en open deze pagina opnieuw.\",\"The brief that teaches a model how to use your tasks through the connection (tools, conventions, and examples).\":\"De handleiding die een model leert hoe het via de verbinding je taken kan gebruiken (hulpmiddelen, afspraken en voorbeelden).\",\"The code expired.\":\"De code is verlopen.\",\"The code works for 10 minutes. After you approve it, this screen continues by itself.\":\"De code is 10 minuten geldig. Zodra je goedkeurt, gaat dit scherm vanzelf verder.\",\"The full task app on one device. You do not need an account.\":\"De volledige takenapp op één apparaat. Je hebt geen account nodig.\",\"The other members lose this project. You keep it and its tasks.\":\"De andere leden raken dit project kwijt. Jij houdt het project en de taken.\",\"The project leaves your account. Everyone else keeps it.\":\"Het project verdwijnt uit je account. De anderen houden het.\",\"The purchase did not go through. Try again in a moment.\":\"De aankoop is niet gelukt. Probeer het zo meteen opnieuw.\",\"The same tasks on your phone, tablet and Mac, updated as you type.\":\"Dezelfde taken op je telefoon, tablet en Mac, direct bijgewerkt terwijl je typt.\",\"The section is no longer available.\":\"De sectie is niet meer beschikbaar.\",\"The section is no longer in this project.\":\"De sectie staat niet meer in dit project.\",\"The selected item is not a section.\":\"Het geselecteerde item is geen sectie.\",\"The task app stays free\":\"De takenapp blijft gratis\",\"The tasks move to Recently Deleted. You can undo this.\":\"De taken worden naar Recent verwijderd verplaatst. Je kunt dit ongedaan maken.\",\"Thinking…\":\"Denkt na…\",\"This Apple ID's Plus belongs to another Septena account. Sign in to that account to use it.\":\"De Plus-aankoop voor deze Apple ID hoort bij een ander Septena-account. Meld je aan bij dat account om die te gebruiken.\",\"This account is already set up. Your tasks are syncing to this device.\":\"Dit account is al ingesteld. Je taken worden met dit apparaat gesynchroniseerd.\",\"This deletes the following from the Septena server:\":\"Dit verwijdert het volgende van de Septena-server:\",\"This device is not syncing\":\"Dit apparaat synchroniseert niet\",\"This file is on another device\":\"Dit bestand staat op een ander apparaat\",\"This invite no longer works. Ask for a new link.\":\"Deze uitnodiging werkt niet meer. Vraag om een nieuwe link.\",\"This project has no room for another member or invite.\":\"Dit project heeft geen plek voor nog een lid of uitnodiging.\",\"This task already has {count} references.\":\"Deze taak heeft al {count} verwijzingen.\",\"Thorough\":\"Grondig\",\"Three\":\"Drie\",\"Thursday\":\"Donderdag\",\"Timed tasks only\":\"Alleen taken met een tijd\",\"Title\":\"Titel\",\"Title lines\":\"Titelregels\",\"To sign in on a new phone, tablet or computer, tap Get a sign-in code on it. Then scan or enter that code here.\":\"Tik op je nieuwe telefoon, tablet of computer op Aanmeldcode ophalen. Scan of voer die code daarna hier in.\",\"Today\":\"Vandaag\",\"Today shows what to do now. Anything you skipped stays on the Get started list.\":\"In Vandaag zie je wat je nu kunt doen. Wat je overslaat blijft op de lijst Aan de slag staan.\",\"Toggle Checklist Item\":\"Checklistitem afvinken\",\"Toggle Favorite\":\"Favoriet aan- of uitzetten\",\"Toggle Today\":\"Vandaag aan- of uitzetten\",\"Tomorrow\":\"Morgen\",\"Too many wrong codes. Try again in 10 minutes.\":\"Te veel onjuiste codes. Probeer het over 10 minuten opnieuw.\",\"Topography\":\"Topografie\",\"Try Plus free for 14 days\":\"Probeer Plus 14 dagen gratis\",\"Try another code\":\"Probeer een andere code\",\"Tuesday\":\"Dinsdag\",\"Two\":\"Twee\",\"Type above to add your first task.\":\"Typ hierboven om je eerste taak toe te voegen.\",\"Type your ",
        "answer\":\"Typ je antwoord\",\"Undo\":\"Ongedaan maken\",\"Unfavorite\":\"Niet meer als favoriet markeren\",\"Unknown device\":\"Onbekend apparaat\",\"Unused invites\":\"Ongebruikte uitnodigingen\",\"Upcoming\":\"Binnenkort\",\"Update Schedule\":\"Schema bijwerken\",\"Use a device where Septena is already signed in.\":\"Gebruik een apparaat waarop Septena al is aangemeld.\",\"Use a device where Septena is already signed in. It approves this one with a code, and your tasks sync here.\":\"Gebruik een apparaat waarop Septena al is aangemeld. Daarmee keur je dit apparaat met een code goed, waarna je taken hier worden gesynchroniseerd.\",\"Use my Claude\":\"Gebruik mijn Claude\",\"Version {version}\":\"Versie {version}\",\"View\":\"Weergeven\",\"Waiting for approval.\":\"Wachten op goedkeuring.\",\"Washi Paper\":\"Washi Paper\",\"We never hold your data back\":\"We houden je gegevens nooit achter\",\"Web page\":\"Webpagina\",\"Wednesday\":\"Woensdag\",\"Week\":\"Week\",\"Welcome back\":\"Welkom terug\",\"Welcome to Septena\":\"Welkom bij Septena\",\"What needs another pass?\":\"Wat moet nog een keer worden bekeken?\",\"What’s the first step?\":\"Wat is de eerste stap?\",\"When\":\"Wanneer\",\"When Claude shows a code, enter it below.\":\"Voer de code hieronder in zodra Claude die toont.\",\"When dates, deadlines and repeats\":\"Datums, deadlines en herhalingen\",\"When off, tasks appear in one list with their project or area underneath.\":\"Als dit uit staat, verschijnen taken in één lijst met het bijbehorende project of gebied eronder.\",\"When…\":\"Wanneer…\",\"Where AI runs\":\"Waar AI wordt uitgevoerd\",\"Where did you stop?\":\"Waar ben je gebleven?\",\"Where you stopped\":\"Waar je gebleven was\",\"While paused, no agent can start or work on a task.\":\"Zolang dit is gepauzeerd, kan geen agent een taak starten of eraan werken.\",\"Whose turn?\":\"Wie is aan de beurt?\",\"Work\":\"Werk\",\"Working\":\"Bezig\",\"Working lists shown at the top of the sidebar.\":\"Actieve lijsten staan bovenaan de zijbalk.\",\"Year\":\"Jaar\",\"You\":\"Jij\",\"You can cancel at any time in Settings.\":\"Je kunt op elk moment opzeggen via Instellingen.\",\"You can undo an import.\":\"Je kunt een import ongedaan maken.\",\"You can undo this.\":\"Je kunt dit ongedaan maken.\",\"You can’t undo this.\":\"Dit kun je niet ongedaan maken.\",\"You decide when it’s done.\":\"Jij bepaalt wanneer het klaar is.\",\"You do not need a card. After 14 days the account becomes a free account, and your tasks stay where they are.\":\"Je hebt geen betaalkaart nodig. Na 14 dagen wordt het account een gratis account en blijven je taken staan.\",\"You have Plus through Google Play. Manage it in Google Play.\":\"Je hebt Plus via Google Play. Beheer het in Google Play.\",\"You have Plus through the App Store.\":\"Je hebt Plus via de App Store.\",\"You have Plus through the web. Manage it at septena.app.\":\"Je hebt Plus via het web. Beheer het op septena.app.\",\"You pay your AI provider, not us\":\"Jij betaalt je AI-aanbieder, niet ons\",\"Your 14 days of Plus have ended\":\"Je 14 dagen Plus zijn verlopen\",\"Your AI, never our servers\":\"Jouw AI, nooit onze servers\",\"Your Profile\":\"Je profiel\",\"Your account becomes a free account. Every device keeps its tasks, and the server keeps your synced copy for 12 months.\":\"Je account wordt een gratis account. Elk apparaat behoudt zijn taken en de server bewaart je gesynchroniseerde kopie 12 maanden.\",\"Your account is now a free account. One device keeps syncing. Your tasks on every device stay where they are.\":\"Je account is nu een gratis account. Eén apparaat blijft synchroniseren. Je taken op elk apparaat blijven staan.\",\"Your agent asks\":\"Je agent vraagt het eerst\",\"Your agents do the work\":\"Je agents doen het werk\",\"Your attachments\":\"Je bijlagen\",\"Your changes stay on this Mac until you sign in.\":\"Je wijzigingen blijven op deze Mac totdat je je aanmeldt.\",\"Your changes stay on this device until you sign in.\":\"Je wijzigingen blijven op dit apparaat totdat je je aanmeldt.\",\"Your changes stay on this iPad until you sign in.\":\"Je wijzigingen blijven op deze iPad totdat je je aanmeldt.\",\"Your changes stay on this iPhone until you sign in.\":\"Je wijzigingen blijven op deze iPhone totdat je je aanmeldt.\",\"Your data\":\"Je gegevens\",\"Your list everywhere\":\"Je lijst overal\",\"Your list on every device, updated live.\":\"Je lijst op elk apparaat, live bijgewerkt.\",\"Your name\":\"Je naam\",\"Your name stays on this device, and syncs when you sign in.\":\"Je naam blijft op dit apparaat en wordt gesynchroniseerd zodra je je aanmeldt.\",\"Your plan\":\"Je abonnement\",\"Your synced settings\":\"Je gesynchroniseerde instellingen\",\"Your task conversations\":\"Je taakgesprekken\",\"Your tasks stay in step on iPhone, iPad and Mac.\":\"Je taken blijven gelijk op iPhone, iPad en Mac.\",\"Your tasks, areas and projects\":\"Je taken, gebieden en projecten\",\"Your tasks, areas, projects, and conversations stay on this device until you sign in. When signed in, they sync through Septena’s private server at api.septena.app, encrypted at rest (not end-to-end, so connected agents can read them when you choose). AI on your device stays on your device. Connect Claude under AI & Agents.\":\"Je taken, gebieden, projecten en gesprekken blijven op dit apparaat totdat je je aanmeldt. Na aanmelding worden ze gesynchroniseerd via de privéserver van Septena op api.septena.app, versleuteld opgeslagen (niet end-to-end, zodat verbonden agents ze kunnen lezen wanneer jij daarvoor kiest). AI op je apparaat blijft op je apparaat. Verbind Claude onder AI en agents.\",\"Your turn: a question is waiting\":\"Jij bent aan zet: er wacht een vraag\",\"You’re all set\":\"Alles is klaar\",\"Yuzu\":\"Yuzu\",\"iPhone or iPad\":\"iPhone of iPad\",\"{app}’s servers never run AI on your tasks. AI runs on your device, or in your own Claude when you connect it. Turn AI off and the app works the same, without conversations.\":\"De servers van {app} voeren nooit AI uit op je taken. AI draait op je apparaat of in je eigen Claude wanneer je die verbindt. Schakel AI uit en de app blijft hetzelfde werken, zonder gesprekken.\",\"{client} can read and change your tasks. You can pause it in AI & Agents.\":\"{client} kan je taken lezen en wijzigen. Je kunt de verbinding pauzeren bij AI en agents.\",\"{client} gets full access to your Septena account, including tasks, lists, conversations and settings. It stays signed in until you sign it out.\":\"{client} krijgt volledige toegang tot je Septena-account, inclusief taken, lijsten, gesprekken en instellingen. De aanmelding blijft actief totdat je je afmeldt.\",\"{client} is signed in.\":\"{client} is aangemeld.\",\"{count} agents\":{\"one\":\"1 agent\",\"other\":\"{count} agents\"},\"{count} files\":{\"one\":\"{count} bestand\",\"other\":\"{count} bestanden\"},\"{count} min\":\"{count} min\",\"{count} minutes are up.\":{\"one\":\"1 minuut is om.\",\"other\":\"{count} minuten zijn om.\"},\"{count} non-task records will be skipped.\":\"{count} records die geen taken zijn, worden overgeslagen.\",\"{count} projects\":{\"one\":\"1 project\",\"other\":\"{count} projecten\"},\"{count} selected\":\"{count} geselecteerd\",\"{count} tags\":{\"one\":\"{count} tag\",\"other\":\"{count} tags\"},\"{count} tasks\":{\"one\":\"1 taak\",\"other\":\"{count} taken\"},\"{count} tasks deleted\":{\"one\":\"Taak verwijderd\",\"other\":\"{count} taken verwijderd\"},\"{count} tasks faded this week\":{\"one\":\"1 taak deze week vervaagd\",\"other\":\"{count} taken deze week vervaagd\"},\"{count} tasks rolled into Today\":{\"one\":\"1 taak verplaatst naar Vandaag\",\"other\":\"{count} taken verplaatst naar Vandaag\"},\"{count} things need you\":{\"one\":\"1 ding wacht op je\",\"other\":\"{count} dingen wachten op je\"},\"{name} can no longer read or change your tasks. To use it again, connect it again.\":\"{name} kan je taken niet meer lezen of wijzigen. Verbind {name} opnieuw om de agent weer te gebruiken.\",\"“{title}” deleted\":\"‘{title}’ verwijderd\",\"€0\":\"€0\",\"€120 a year\":\"€120 per jaar\",\"€5 a month. You save €24 against paying monthly.\":\"€5 per maand. Je bespaart €24 ten opzichte van maandelijks betalen.\",\"€60 a year\":\"€60 per jaar\",\"€60 a year or €7 a month\":\"€60 per jaar of €7 per maand\",\"€7 a month\":\"€7 per maand\",\"{count} reminders moved to the Inbox\":{\"one\":\"Herinnering naar Postvak IN verplaatst\",\"other\":\"{count} herinneringen naar Postvak IN verplaatst\"},\"Replace the tasks on this device?\":\"Taken op dit apparaat vervangen?\",\"You signed in with a different account. The tasks on this device belong to the account you used before. They are removed from this device, and this account’s tasks take their place.\":\"Je bent ingelogd met een ander account. De taken op dit apparaat horen bij het account dat je eerder gebruikte. Ze worden van dit apparaat verwijderd en de taken van dit account komen ervoor in de plaats.\",\"1 task is on this device.\":\"Er staat 1 taak op dit apparaat.\",\"{count} tasks are on this device.\":\"Er staan {count} taken op dit apparaat.\",\"1 change was not sent yet and will be lost.\":\"1 wijziging is nog niet verstuurd en gaat verloren.\",\"{count} changes were not sent yet and will be lost.\":\"{count} wijzigingen zijn nog niet verstuurd en gaan verloren.\",\"Export a Backup First\":\"Eerst een back-up exporteren\",\"Replace\":\"Vervangen\",\"New Agent Key\":\"Nieuwe agentsleutel\",\"Your agent key\":\"Je agentsleutel\",\"Septena shows this key only once. Paste it into your script or agent. To stop the agent, disconnect it in this list.\":\"Septena toont deze sleutel maar één keer. Plak hem in je script of agent. Wil je de agent stoppen, ontkoppel hem dan in deze lijst.\",\"Copy Key\":\"Sleutel kopiëren\"},\"pt-BR\":{\"1\":\"1\",\"3\":\"3\",\"10 GB synced\":\"10 GB sincronizados\",\"1st\":\"1º\",\"2nd\":\"2º\",\"30 days\":\"30 dias\",\"365 days\":\"365 dias\",\"3rd\":\"3º\",\"4th\":\"4º\",\"A free account allows 500 agent changes a day. Your agent can make changes again tomorrow. Plus has no daily limit.\":\"Uma conta gratuita permite 500 alterações por dia feitas por agentes. Seu agente poderá voltar a fazer alterações amanhã. O Plus não tem limite diário.\",\"A free account shows 30 days of history. Plus shows a full year.\":\"A conta gratuita mostra 30 dias de histórico. O Plus mostra um ano completo.\",\"A free account syncs one device. Plus syncs all of them. You can also move your free account to this device.\":\"A conta gratuita sincroniza um dispositivo. O Plus sincroniza todos eles. Você também pode transferir sua conta gratuita para este dispositivo.\",\"ABCD-EFGH\":\"ABCD-EFGH\",\"AI & Agents\":\"IA e agentes\",\"AI Mode\":\"Modo de IA\",\"AI Preferences\":\"Preferências de IA\",\"AI asks what you mean. Nothing happens until you answer.\":\"A IA pergunta o que você quer dizer. Nada acontece até você responder.\",\"AI on this device\":\"IA neste dispositivo\",\"AI’s turn: it’s working\":\"Vez da IA: ela está trabalhando\",\"About\":\"Sobre\",\"Above Areas & Projects\":\"Acima de Áreas e projetos\",\"Accent\":\"Destaque\",\"Accept\":\"Aceitar\",\"Accepted\":\"Aceita\",\"Account\":\"Conta\",\"Active {time}\":\"Ativo {time}\",\"Active {time} · not syncing\":\"Ativo {time} · sem sincronização\",\"Add\":\"Adicionar\",\"Add Checklist Item\":\"Adicionar item à checklist\",\"Add Reference\":\"Adicionar referência\",\"Add Reference…\":\"Adicionar referência…\",\"Add Reminder…\":\"Adicionar lembrete…\",\"Add a task or move one here when you want to work on it today.\":\"Adicione uma tarefa ou mova uma para cá quando quiser trabalhar nela hoje.\",\"Add and Do\":\"Adicionar e fazer\",\"Add time\":\"Adicionar horário\",\"Add your first task\":\"Adicione sua primeira tarefa\",\"Add {name} as a reference\":\"Adicionar {name} como referência\",\"Added by\":\"Adicionado por\",\"Advanced\":\"Avançado\",\"Agent\":\"Agente\",\"Agent name\":\"Nome do agente\",\"Agent tools\":\"Ferramentas de agente\",\"Agents\":\"Agentes\",\"All dated tasks\":\"Todas as tarefas com data\",\"All your devices\":\"Todos os seus dispositivos\",\"Allow calendar access\":\"Permitir acesso ao calendário\",\"Allow camera access for Septena in Settings, or enter the code instead.\":\"Permita que o app Septena use a câmera em Ajustes ou digite o código.\",\"Already a task\":\"Já é uma tarefa\",\"Also in {name}\":\"Também em {name}\",\"Always shown\":\"Sempre exibido\",\"An agent below\":\"Um dos agentes abaixo\",\"Android\":\"Android\",\"Anyone can join a shared project for free. Plus lets you create one and invite people.\":\"Qualquer pess",
        "oa pode participar de um projeto compartilhado gratuitamente. Com o Plus, você pode criar um projeto e convidar pessoas.\",\"Anything only you can do (pay, send) becomes one clear button.\":\"O que só você pode fazer (pagar, enviar) vira um botão bem claro.\",\"Anytime\":\"A qualquer momento\",\"Appearance\":\"Aparência\",\"Apple Intelligence\":\"Apple Intelligence\",\"Apple Watch\":\"Apple Watch\",\"Approve\":\"Aprovar\",\"Approve a sign-in\":\"Aprovar acesso\",\"Approving…\":\"Aprovando…\",\"Archive and utility lists shown below your areas and projects. Drag to reorder within a section, or use the arrow button to move a list above or below. Changes sync across all your devices.\":\"As listas arquivadas e auxiliares aparecem abaixo das áreas e dos projetos. Arraste para reordená-las dentro de uma seção ou use as setas para movê-las para cima ou para baixo. As alterações são sincronizadas em todos os dispositivos.\",\"Archive and utility lists shown below your areas and projects. Use the arrows to reorder a list or to move it above or below. Changes sync across all your devices.\":\"As listas arquivadas e auxiliares aparecem abaixo das áreas e dos projetos. Use as setas para reordená-las ou movê-las para cima ou para baixo. As alterações são sincronizadas em todos os dispositivos.\",\"Area\":\"Área\",\"Area name\":\"Nome da área\",\"Areas, projects, sections, notes and attachments\":\"Áreas, projetos, seções, notas e anexos\",\"Assign To\":\"Atribuir a\",\"Attachments\":\"Anexos\",\"Automatic\":\"Automático\",\"Açaí\":\"Açaí\",\"Backup on our server\":\"Backup no nosso servidor\",\"Balanced\":\"Equilibrado\",\"Baseline\":\"Padrão\",\"Below Areas & Projects\":\"Abaixo de Áreas e projetos\",\"Beyond conversations, {app} learns small patterns locally, like the “Move to…” suggestion that predicts where a task belongs from your own history. That model trains on your device and never leaves it.\":\"Além das conversas, o app {app} aprende padrões de uso no próprio dispositivo, como a sugestão “Mover para…”, que prevê onde você costuma guardar uma tarefa com base no seu histórico. Esse modelo é treinado no dispositivo e nunca sai dele.\",\"Blocked by\":\"Bloqueada por\",\"Bring in your tasks\":\"Importar suas tarefas\",\"Browser\":\"Navegador\",\"Calendar\":\"Calendário\",\"Calendar Feed (iCal)\":\"Feed de calendário (iCal)\",\"Calendar event\":\"Evento do calendário\",\"Cancel\":\"Cancelar\",\"Cancel Project\":\"Cancelar projeto\",\"Cancel Task\":\"Cancelar tarefa\",\"Cancel Tasks\":\"Cancelar tarefas\",\"Cancel at any time\":\"Cancele quando quiser\",\"Cancel at any time.\":\"Cancele quando quiser.\",\"Capture\":\"Capturar\",\"Carambola\":\"Carambola\",\"Change Emoji…\":\"Mudar emoji…\",\"Change history\":\"Histórico de alterações\",\"Changes the server refused appear here, newest first. The server kept its own version of each.\":\"Aqui aparecem as alterações recusadas pelo servidor, começando pelas mais recentes. O servidor manteve sua própria versão de cada uma.\",\"Check for Updates…\":\"Verificar atualizações…\",\"Checking the code…\":\"Verificando o código…\",\"Checklist\":\"Checklist\",\"Classic Window\":\"Janela clássica\",\"Claude is connected. Go back to your browser to finish.\":\"O Claude está conectado. Volte ao navegador para concluir.\",\"Claude reads and changes your tasks through your Septena account. You decide which tasks it works on.\":\"O Claude lê e altera suas tarefas pela sua conta Septena. Você decide em quais tarefas ele trabalha.\",\"Clear\":\"Limpar\",\"Clear (Anytime)\":\"Limpar (A qualquer momento)\",\"Clear Logged…\":\"Limpar registros…\",\"Clear When\":\"Limpar Quando\",\"Clear sync issues\":\"Limpar problemas de sincronização\",\"Clear {count} logged items from “{name}”?\":{\"one\":\"Limpar 1 item do registro de “{name}”?\",\"other\":\"Limpar {count} itens do registro de “{name}”?\"},\"Cleared items move to Recently Deleted. You can undo this.\":\"Os itens removidos vão para Apagadas recentemente. Você pode desfazer essa ação.\",\"Click + or double-click below to add a task.\":\"Clique em + ou dê um clique duplo abaixo para adicionar uma tarefa.\",\"Close\":\"Fechar\",\"Code from the browser page\":\"Código exibido no navegador\",\"Colorful\":\"Colorido\",\"Complete\":\"Concluir\",\"Completed\":\"Concluída\",\"Completion animations\":\"Animações ao concluir\",\"Confirm\":\"Confirmar\",\"Connect Claude\":\"Conectar o Claude\",\"Connect Claude or another agent to your list. It asks before it acts, and you can stop it at any time.\":\"Conecte o Claude ou outro agente à sua lista. Ele pede sua autorização antes de agir, e você pode interrompê-lo quando quiser.\",\"Connect your agent\":\"Conecte seu agente\",\"Connect {client} to your tasks?\":\"Conectar {client} às suas tarefas?\",\"Connected agents\":\"Agentes conectados\",\"Connections\":\"Conexões\",\"Connector URL\":\"URL do conector\",\"Continue\":\"Continuar\",\"Conversation\":\"Conversa\",\"Copied\":\"Copiado\",\"Copies your areas, projects and tasks. Things stays as it is.\":\"Copia suas áreas, projetos e tarefas. O Things permanece inalterado.\",\"Copy\":\"Copiar\",\"Copy Link\":\"Copiar link\",\"Copy Skill\":\"Copiar skill\",\"Copy URL\":\"Copiar URL\",\"Copy first prompt\":\"Copiar primeiro prompt\",\"Copy setup prompt\":\"Copiar prompt de configuração\",\"Copy the setup prompt and paste it into Claude.\":\"Copie o prompt de configuração e cole no Claude.\",\"Could not reach Septena.\":\"Não foi possível conectar ao Septena.\",\"Couldn’t add the reference.\":\"Não foi possível adicionar a referência.\",\"Couldn’t delete your account. Nothing was deleted.\":\"Não foi possível excluir sua conta. Nada foi excluído.\",\"Create\":\"Criar\",\"Create Next Copy\":\"Criar próxima cópia\",\"Create and invite\":\"Criar e convidar\",\"Created from {name}\":\"Criada a partir de {name}\",\"Current device\":\"Dispositivo atual\",\"Daily change limit reached\":\"Você atingiu o limite diário de alterações.\",\"Dark\":\"Escuro\",\"Day\":\"Dia\",\"Deadline\":\"Prazo\",\"Deadline…\":\"Prazo…\",\"Decide\":\"Decidir\",\"Decrease Text Size\":\"Diminuir tamanho do texto\",\"Delete\":\"Apagar\",\"Delete Area\":\"Apagar área\",\"Delete Checklist Item\":\"Apagar item da checklist\",\"Delete Permanently\":\"Apagar permanentemente\",\"Delete Project\":\"Apagar projeto\",\"Delete Section\":\"Apagar seção\",\"Delete Tasks\":\"Apagar tarefas\",\"Delete account\":\"Excluir conta\",\"Delete all {count} deleted tasks permanently?\":{\"one\":\"Apagar definitivamente a tarefa já apagada?\",\"other\":\"Apagar definitivamente todas as {count} tarefas já apagadas?\"},\"Delete this section?\":\"Apagar esta seção?\",\"Delete your account?\":\"Excluir sua conta?\",\"Delete {count} tasks permanently?\":{\"one\":\"Apagar esta tarefa permanentemente?\",\"other\":\"Apagar {count} tarefas permanentemente?\"},\"Delete “{name}” and its {projectPhrase}? (projects only)\":\"Apagar “{name}” e seus {projectPhrase}?\",\"Delete “{name}” and its {taskPhrase}?\":\"Apagar “{name}” e suas {taskPhrase}?\",\"Delete “{name}”, its {projectPhrase} and {taskPhrase}?\":\"Apagar “{name}”, seus {projectPhrase} e {taskPhrase}?\",\"Delete “{name}”?\":\"Apagar “{name}”?\",\"Deleted\":\"Apagadas\",\"Deletes your account and all your tasks on the Septena server.\":\"Exclui sua conta e todas as suas tarefas no servidor do Septena.\",\"Deselect All\":\"Desmarcar tudo\",\"Device calendars\":\"Calendários do dispositivo\",\"Devices\":\"Dispositivos\",\"Diagnostics\":\"Diagnóstico\",\"Disconnect\":\"Desconectar\",\"Disconnect {name}?\":\"Desconectar {name}?\",\"Discuss\":\"Conversar\",\"Discuss never leaves this device. Septena has no on-device model here, so Discuss is off.\":\"As conversas sobre tarefas ficam somente neste dispositivo. Como o app Septena não tem um modelo local aqui, esse recurso está desativado.\",\"Dismiss\":\"Dispensar\",\"Do\":\"Fazer\",\"Do Here\":\"Fazer aqui\",\"Does what it can: a draft, a comparison. Uses the web or your Claude only when needed.\":\"Faz o que pode, como criar um rascunho ou comparar opções. Só acessa a internet ou seu Claude quando necessário.\",\"Doing now\":\"Fazendo agora\",\"Doing {title}\":\"Fazendo {title}\",\"Don't approve\":\"Não aprovar\",\"Done\":\"Concluído\",\"Duplicate\":\"Duplicar\",\"Duplicate Tasks\":\"Duplicar tarefas\",\"Each agent you connected to your tasks, with the name you gave it. An agent counts while it was used in the last 30 days. Your phones, tablets and computers are under Account, Devices.\":\"Cada agente que você conectou às suas tarefas, com o nome que escolheu. Um agente conta se foi usado nos últimos 30 dias. Seus celulares, tablets e computadores aparecem em Conta, Dispositivos.\",\"Each app you signed in to. A device you sign out stops syncing within the hour.\":\"Cada app em que você entrou. Quando você sai de um dispositivo, ele para de sincronizar em até uma hora.\",\"Each link works for one person and lasts 7 days.\":\"Cada link serve para uma pessoa e vale por 7 dias.\",\"Each project has notes, so you and Claude know what it’s for.\":\"Cada projeto tem notas, para você e o Claude saberem para que ele serve.\",\"Early builds on TestFlight\":\"Versões iniciais no TestFlight\",\"Edit Details…\":\"Editar detalhes…\",\"Elevation\":\"Elevação\",\"Email\":\"E-mail\",\"Email thread\":\"Conversa por e-mail\",\"Empty Trash\":\"Esvaziar lixeira\",\"Ended\":\"Encerrada\",\"Enter the code from the other device. If you're connecting Claude, the code is in your browser.\":\"Digite o código do outro dispositivo. Se estiver conectando o Claude, o código aparece no navegador.\",\"Error\":\"Erro\",\"Every list, from Today to the Logbook\":\"Todas as listas, de Hoje ao Registro\",\"Every new account starts with 14 days of Plus\":\"Toda conta nova começa com 14 dias de Plus\",\"Every plan has the full task app\":\"Todos os planos incluem o app de tarefas completo\",\"Every task feature is free on the device you use. A free account adds a backup and lets you connect one agent. Plus covers all your devices, three agents, synced files and a longer history.\":\"Todos os recursos de tarefas são gratuitos no dispositivo que você usa. Uma conta gratuita inclui um backup e permite conectar um agente. O Plus cobre todos os seus dispositivos, três agentes, arquivos sincronizados e um histórico mais longo.\",\"Everything in Free is included.\":\"Tudo o que está no plano Grátis está incluído.\",\"Everything in Plus is included.\":\"Tudo o que está no Plus está incluído.\",\"Existing items with matching IDs are kept; new items are added and synced.\":\"Itens existentes com o mesmo ID são mantidos; novos itens são adicionados e sincronizados.\",\"Expires\":\"Expira\",\"Export CSV\":\"Exportar CSV\",\"Export JSON backup\":\"Exportar backup JSON\",\"Export Markdown\":\"Exportar Markdown\",\"Export as JSON\":\"Exportar como JSON\",\"Export everything as plain JSON\":\"Exportar tudo como JSON simples\",\"Export failed.\":\"Não foi possível exportar.\",\"Export works on every plan. A limit hides older items. It never deletes them, and Plus shows them again.\":\"A exportação está disponível em todos os planos. O limite apenas oculta os itens mais antigos; eles não são apagados e voltam a aparecer com o Plus.\",\"Exported CSV.\":\"CSV exportado.\",\"Exported JSON backup.\":\"Backup JSON exportado.\",\"Exported Markdown.\":\"Markdown exportado.\",\"Fade inactive tasks\":\"Diminuir o destaque das tarefas inativas\",\"Faded\":\"Inativas\",\"Faded Tasks\":\"Tarefas inativas\",\"Favorite\":\"Favoritar\",\"Favorite important tasks to keep them one tap away.\":\"Marque as tarefas importantes como favoritas para acessá-las com um toque.\",\"Favorites\":\"Favoritas\",\"Field Matrix\":\"Matriz de campo\",\"File\":\"Arquivo\",\"Files\":\"Arquivos\",\"Find any task, project, or area.\":\"Encontre qualquer tarefa, projeto ou área.\",\"Finished work\":\"Trabalho concluído\",\"First prompt\":\"Primeiro prompt\",\"Follow-up to\":\"Acompanhamento de\",\"For people who run many agents on one list.\":\"Para quem usa vários agentes em uma lista.\",\"Found {areas} areas, {projects} projects, and {tasks} tasks.\":\"Encontradas {areas} áreas, {projects} projetos e {tasks} tarefas.\",\"Free\":\"Grátis\",\"Free account\":\"Conta gratuita\",\"Free on one device. Plus on all of them.\":\"Grátis em um dispositivo. Plus em todos.\",\"Friday\":\"Sexta-feira\",\"Full Septena tasks, areas, projects, and checklists (importable)\":\"Tarefas, áreas, projetos e checklists do Septena (prontos para importar)\",\"General\":\"Geral\",\"Get a new code\":\"Obter um novo código\",\"Get a sign-in code\":\"Obter um código de acesso\",\"Get started with Septena\":\"Comece a usar o Septena\",\"GitHub issue\"",
        ":\"Issue do GitHub\",\"Give any task a Repeat rule and it will show up here.\":\"Defina uma repetição para qualquer tarefa e ela aparecerá aqui.\",\"Go\":\"Ir\",\"Group Today by list\":\"Agrupar Hoje por lista\",\"Hand off\":\"Atribuir\",\"Haskap\":\"Haskap\",\"Header Texture\":\"Textura do cabeçalho\",\"Height Map\":\"Mapa de altura\",\"Help\":\"Ajuda\",\"Help that keeps working\":\"Uma ajuda que continua funcionando\",\"Hide Get Started\":\"Ocultar Primeiros passos\",\"Hide Info\":\"Ocultar informações\",\"Hide Sidebar\":\"Ocultar barra lateral\",\"Hide Sidebar Counts\":\"Ocultar contagens da barra lateral\",\"History\":\"Histórico\",\"How AI helps\":\"Como a IA ajuda\",\"How AI helps with your tasks\":\"Como a IA ajuda nas suas tarefas\",\"How a task conversation moves\":\"Como uma conversa sobre tarefas avança\",\"If this agent takes the place of one you connected before, pick it. That agent stops working.\":\"Se este agente vai substituir um que você já conectou, selecione-o. O outro agente deixará de funcionar.\",\"If you skip this, your tasks stay on this device until you sign in.\":\"Se você pular isto, suas tarefas ficam neste dispositivo até você entrar.\",\"If you subscribe during the trial, billing starts on the day you subscribe.\":\"Se você assinar durante o período de teste, a cobrança começa no dia da assinatura.\",\"Import\":\"Importar\",\"Import & Export\":\"Importar e exportar\",\"Import JSON backup…\":\"Importar backup JSON…\",\"Import Septena backup\":\"Importar backup do Septena\",\"Import failed.\":\"Não foi possível importar.\",\"Import from another app\":\"Importar de outro app\",\"Import from other task apps\":\"Importar de outros apps de tarefas\",\"Imported {count} items.\":\"{count} itens importados.\",\"Inactive tasks start to fade\":\"As tarefas inativas começam a perder destaque.\",\"Inbox\":\"Caixa de entrada\",\"Inbox is empty\":\"A caixa de entrada está vazia\",\"Inbox zero animation\":\"Animação ao esvaziar a caixa de ent